flowchart LR
    A[Shared Memory Setup] --> B[Process A: shm_open]
    B --> C["fd = shm_open('/myshm', O_CREAT|O_RDWR, 0666)"]
    C --> D["ftruncate(fd, SIZE)"]
    D --> E["ptr = mmap(NULL, SIZE, PROT_RW, MAP_SHARED, fd, 0)"]
    
    F[Process B: shm_open] --> G["fd = shm_open('/myshm', O_RDWR, 0)"]
    G --> H["ptr = mmap(NULL, SIZE, PROT_RW, MAP_SHARED, fd, 0)"]
    
    E --> I[Both processes share memory region]
    H --> I
    
    I --> J[Process A writes]
    J --> K[Process B reads - instant!]
    
    L[Cleanup] --> M["munmap(ptr, SIZE)"]
    M --> N["shm_unlink('/myshm')"]
    
    O[Synchronization] --> P[Use semaphores]
    O --> Q[Use mutexes pthread_mutex]
    O --> R[Use atomic operations]
    
    style I fill:#e8f5e8
    style K fill:#d4edda
    style O fill:#fff4e1
